WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.180
Speaker 1: Sanna Marin, the prime minister
of Finland, has been under fire lately for

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:09.870
one of the dumbest political scandals imaginable,
for partying and dancing and having a good

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.269
time, the clips of which were made public.

00:00:12.269 --> 00:00:17.010
Moran is 36 years old, making her one of the
youngest world leaders.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.010
And good for her.

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:21.810
She likes to have fun every now and then go
to house parties in nightclubs and dance,

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:25.510
presumably have a few drinks and just all
around, have a good time.

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:30.900
And she's actually had to respond to criticism
over this, both from the Finnish people and

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.660
from people across the world.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:36.280
There are some right wing commentators here
in the U.S. who are making a fuss about this,

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.489
saying that this is unbecoming of a prime
minister.

00:00:39.489 --> 00:00:41.020
What if she was on drugs?

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:44.050
What if there was an emergency that she had
to deal with at that very moment?

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:45.660
What would the world have done?

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:50.059
And it's clear to me that a lot of these attacks
are a just and misogynistic, because you want

00:00:50.059 --> 00:00:52.890
to make them about an older man, for example.

00:00:52.890 --> 00:01:01.980
But let's first check out the ever so controversial
video of her partying and having a good time.

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:08.010
Speaker 5: Fine.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:10.020
Hmm.

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:14.040
I think.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:20.070
So it's so.

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:25.380
Speaker 1: I mean.

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:26.380
All right.

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:30.950
So if you were just listening and you were
in watching along there, she's just dancing

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:34.799
and making some cool poses and having some
fun with her friends.

00:01:34.799 --> 00:01:37.659
There's really nothing out of the ordinary
about it.

00:01:37.659 --> 00:01:41.040
But despite all this, she had to give a response
to reporters.

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:45.729
Moran has said in response to the videos that
she's agreed to take a drug test, which I

00:01:45.729 --> 00:01:49.390
don't think that she should have had to do
or should have been pressured into.

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:52.880
But the results of that drug test are supposedly
coming come out within the week.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:56.770
And she's also made the statement, I did nothing
illegal, which is very much true.

00:01:56.770 --> 00:02:00.930
And even in my teenage years, I have not used
any kind of drug.

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:05.030
And then in response to the idea of like,
oh, well, what if an emergency came up?

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:08.410
She said, I don't remember a single time that
there was a sudden situation in the middle

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:10.760
of the night to go to the State Council palace.

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:13.410
I think my ability to function was really
good.

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:16.590
There were no known meetings on the days I
was partying.

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:20.790
So this readiness to respond if there was
an attack or something seems to be based on

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:22.970
the presumption that she was drinking.

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:27.070
And we don't know, by the way, if she was
drinking or drinking to excess, but even if

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:31.540
she was like, this is not a standard that
we hold to other leaders, other world leaders,

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:35.470
that they can't have a drink every now and
then, that they can't get a little buzz going.

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:38.130
Why is this being unfairly applied to her?

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:42.530
And then after the initial clips came out,
we also got a clip of Moran dancing with someone

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:44.430
who is not her husband.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:48.100
And some people were upset with that, even
though if you look at the video, the dancing

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.680
seems pretty platonic.

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:53.480
And she's actually trying to back away from
the guy who making advances on her.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.320
She at one point puts her arm up.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.660
So that's the situation.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:59.340
Any way for her to deal with her husband with?

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.340
Right.

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:03.640
It's not really a matter of public interest,
in my opinion, but it's another thing that

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.980
they can criticize her for.

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:10.030
And the big takeaway really is that people
need to chill out a little bit and let loose

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:12.370
and not take things so seriously all the time.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:16.310
And if you're one of those people who are
just too uptight and you can't let loose every

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:20.560
now and then, at least let other people let
loose and not take things so seriously all

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:21.560
the time.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:24.700
And also, let's apply these criticisms equally,
please.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:30.450
Like when Donald Trump danced to the YMCA,
people were making criticisms about his dancing

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:31.450
abilities.

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:32.450
Right.

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:33.450
Because it looks kind of awkward.

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:38.310
But aside from that, no one was saying, oh,
he needs to take a drug test and this is unbecoming

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:39.920
of a president of the United States.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.950
And what if we were attacked at that given
moment?

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.130
Would he have been able to respond?

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:44.790
No one was saying that.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:48.100
But apparently people are willing to make
these criticisms against Moran because she

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:52.150
actually can dance and she's young and a woman
and all of these different things.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:54.400
So it's definitely a double standard.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.400
It's pretty transparent.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:04:17.060
And the bottom line is people just need to
chill out and apply these 

00:04:17.060 --> 00:05:19.560
standards equally.

